/T (Markets for biodiversity products that are produced in a manner that is demonstrably beneficial to biodiversity have grown rapidly in the past decade, most notably for sustainably harvested forestry products and some foods. These markets are also driven by an increasing focus by consumers on the quality and safety of products they consume, particularly food. )
