/ActualText (Finally, we at ED4S remain committed to advancing investor education, training, and capacity building, on sustainability issues as ecologically and as economically critical as biodiversity loss. As such, we do hope that the information put forward in this biodiversity loss and natural capital overview will spur investment committees, investment teams, board of directors, and other economic decision makers to think deeply and act decisively to address this urgent planetary challenge.   )
